{"componentChunkName":"component---src-templates-post-template-js","path":"/blog/2024-12-22-how-to-use-cookies-in-react-js/","result":{"data":{"markdownRemark":{"excerpt":"Hi Friends 👋, Welcome To aHoisting! To use cookies in react js, you have to use hooks like  for an intuitive that’s how you can use cookies in react js. Today…","html":"<p>Hi Friends 👋,</p>\n<p>Welcome To aHoisting!</p>\n<p>To use cookies in react js, you have to use hooks like <code class=\"language-text\">useCookies</code> for an intuitive that’s how you can use cookies in react js.</p>\n<p>Today, I am going to show you, how to use cookies in react js.</p>\n<h2>Installation</h2>\n<p>Install the following packages to use cookies in react js.</p>\n<p><code class=\"language-text\">npm</code></p>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"js\"><pre class=\"language-js\"><code class=\"language-js\">npm install react<span class=\"token operator\">-</span>cookie\n</code></pre></div>\n<p><code class=\"language-text\">yarn</code></p>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"js\"><pre class=\"language-js\"><code class=\"language-js\">yarn add react<span class=\"token operator\">-</span>cookie\n</code></pre></div>\n<p>Table of contents</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Install and create a new React app.</li>\n<li>Import react component.</li>\n<li>Create a Component.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Let’s start with the first step.</p>\n<h2>Step 1: Install and create a new React app.</h2>\n<p>First you have to install the React project. You should use <code class=\"language-text\">create-react-app</code> command to create a new React project.</p>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"js\"><pre class=\"language-js\"><code class=\"language-js\">npx create<span class=\"token operator\">-</span>react<span class=\"token operator\">-</span>app my<span class=\"token operator\">-</span>app\ncd my<span class=\"token operator\">-</span>app\nnpm start</code></pre></div>\n<h2>Step 2: Import react component.</h2>\n<p>After installing, you have to import your React component.</p>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"js\"><pre class=\"language-js\"><code class=\"language-js\"><span class=\"token keyword\">import</span> React <span class=\"token keyword\">from</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"react\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n<span class=\"token keyword\">import</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span> useCookies <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">from</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"react-cookie\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span></code></pre></div>\n<h2>Step 3: Create a Component.</h2>\n<p>You can use <code class=\"language-text\">onClick={setCookieHandler}</code> to use cookies in react js.</p>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"js\"><pre class=\"language-js\"><code class=\"language-js\"><span class=\"token operator\">&lt;</span>div<span class=\"token operator\">></span>\n  <span class=\"token operator\">&lt;</span>button onClick<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>setCookieHandler<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span><span class=\"token operator\">></span>Set Cookie<span class=\"token operator\">&lt;</span><span class=\"token operator\">/</span>button<span class=\"token operator\">></span>\n  <span class=\"token operator\">&lt;</span>button onClick<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>getCookieHandler<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span><span class=\"token operator\">></span>Get Cookie<span class=\"token operator\">&lt;</span><span class=\"token operator\">/</span>button<span class=\"token operator\">></span>\n  <span class=\"token operator\">&lt;</span>button onClick<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>removeCookieHandler<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span><span class=\"token operator\">></span>Delete Cookie<span class=\"token operator\">&lt;</span><span class=\"token operator\">/</span>button<span class=\"token operator\">></span>\n<span class=\"token operator\">&lt;</span><span class=\"token operator\">/</span>div<span class=\"token operator\">></span></code></pre></div>\n<h2>Use cookies example.</h2>\n<p>The below code is an example of a React. You have to import <code class=\"language-text\">\"react-cookie\"</code> and use hooks like <code class=\"language-text\">useCookies</code> for an intuitive to use cookies in react js.</p>\n<p><code class=\"language-text\">App.js</code></p>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"js\"><pre class=\"language-js\"><code class=\"language-js\"><span class=\"token keyword\">import</span> React <span class=\"token keyword\">from</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"react\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n<span class=\"token keyword\">import</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span> useCookies <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">from</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"react-cookie\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n\n<span class=\"token keyword\">const</span> <span class=\"token function-variable function\">ReactCookieExample</span> <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token operator\">=></span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\n  <span class=\"token keyword\">const</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span>cookies<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> setCookie<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> removeCookie<span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span> <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token function\">useCookies</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token string\">\"username\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n\n  <span class=\"token comment\">// Set a cookie</span>\n  <span class=\"token keyword\">const</span> <span class=\"token function-variable function\">setCookieHandler</span> <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token operator\">=></span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\n    <span class=\"token function\">setCookie</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string\">\"username\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"JohnDoe\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span> <span class=\"token literal-property property\">path</span><span class=\"token operator\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"/\"</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n  <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n\n  <span class=\"token comment\">// Get a cookie</span>\n  <span class=\"token keyword\">const</span> <span class=\"token function-variable function\">getCookieHandler</span> <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token operator\">=></span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\n    console<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token function\">log</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>cookies<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>username<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span> <span class=\"token comment\">// Access the cookie</span>\n  <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n\n  <span class=\"token comment\">// Delete a cookie</span>\n  <span class=\"token keyword\">const</span> <span class=\"token function-variable function\">removeCookieHandler</span> <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token operator\">=></span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\n    <span class=\"token function\">removeCookie</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string\">\"username\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n  <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n\n  <span class=\"token keyword\">return</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>\n    <span class=\"token operator\">&lt;</span>div<span class=\"token operator\">></span>\n      <span class=\"token operator\">&lt;</span>button onClick<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>setCookieHandler<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span><span class=\"token operator\">></span>Set Cookie<span class=\"token operator\">&lt;</span><span class=\"token operator\">/</span>button<span class=\"token operator\">></span>\n      <span class=\"token operator\">&lt;</span>button onClick<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>getCookieHandler<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span><span class=\"token operator\">></span>Get Cookie<span class=\"token operator\">&lt;</span><span class=\"token operator\">/</span>button<span class=\"token operator\">></span>\n      <span class=\"token operator\">&lt;</span>button onClick<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>removeCookieHandler<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span><span class=\"token operator\">></span>Delete Cookie<span class=\"token operator\">&lt;</span><span class=\"token operator\">/</span>button<span class=\"token operator\">></span>\n    <span class=\"token operator\">&lt;</span><span class=\"token operator\">/</span>div<span class=\"token operator\">></span>\n  <span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n\n<span class=\"token keyword\">export</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">default</span> ReactCookieExample<span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n<p>In the above code example, I have used the <code class=\"language-text\">\"react-cookie\"</code> to use cookies in react js.</p>\n<p>Check the output of the above code.</p>\n<p><span\n      class=\"gatsby-resp-image-wrapper\"\n      style=\"position: relative; display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; max-width: 630px; \"\n    >\n      <a\n    class=\"gatsby-resp-image-link\"\n    href=\"/static/e9fd00bc6d93955c4c43573597f8b2a2/ec897/use-cookies.webp\"\n    style=\"display: block\"\n    target=\"_blank\"\n    rel=\"noopener\"\n  >\n    <span\n    class=\"gatsby-resp-image-background-image\"\n    style=\"padding-bottom: 50%; position: relative; bottom: 0; left: 0; background-image: url('data:image/webp;base64,UklGRk4AAABXRUJQVlA4IEIAAABQAwCdASoUAAoAPtFcpkyoJSOiMAgBABoJZwAAW+s26GbaAAD+7bPRIpBrEzHgA8M0bYTBEnq1CUsNoEiPGETAAAA='); background-size: cover; display: block;\"\n  ></span>\n  <img\n        class=\"gatsby-resp-image-image\"\n        alt=\"React, use, cookies\"\n        title=\"React, use, cookies\"\n        src=\"/static/e9fd00bc6d93955c4c43573597f8b2a2/8aab1/use-cookies.webp\"\n        srcset=\"/static/e9fd00bc6d93955c4c43573597f8b2a2/81b7c/use-cookies.webp 158w,\n/static/e9fd00bc6d93955c4c43573597f8b2a2/6ea66/use-cookies.webp 315w,\n/static/e9fd00bc6d93955c4c43573597f8b2a2/8aab1/use-cookies.webp 630w,\n/static/e9fd00bc6d93955c4c43573597f8b2a2/a70f5/use-cookies.webp 945w,\n/static/e9fd00bc6d93955c4c43573597f8b2a2/4ef06/use-cookies.webp 1260w,\n/static/e9fd00bc6d93955c4c43573597f8b2a2/ec897/use-cookies.webp 1366w\"\n        sizes=\"(max-width: 630px) 100vw, 630px\"\n        style=\"width:100%;height:100%;margin:0;vertical-align:middle;position:absolute;top:0;left:0;\"\n        loading=\"lazy\"\n        decoding=\"async\"\n      />\n  </a>\n    </span></p>\n<p>All the best 👍</p>","frontmatter":{"title":"How to use cookies in React js?","tags":["React"],"date":"December 22, 2024","description":"Example of use cookies in react js with step by step tutorial - aHoisting","social_image":{"absolutePath":"/Users/mac/Documents/hoisting/ahoisting/static/media/template/reactjs.jpg"}}},"prev":{"frontmatter":{"title":"How to use context api in react js?"},"fields":{"slug":"/blog/2024-12-22-how-to-use-context-api-in-react-js/"}},"next":{"frontmatter":{"title":"How to use draft js in react js?"},"fields":{"slug":"/blog/2024-12-21-how-to-use-draft-js-in-react-js/"}}},"pageContext":{"slug":"/blog/2024-12-22-how-to-use-cookies-in-react-js/","prevSlug":"/blog/2024-12-22-how-to-use-context-api-in-react-js/","nextSlug":"/blog/2024-12-21-how-to-use-draft-js-in-react-js/"}},"staticQueryHashes":["2555585279","2714594843","3159585216"]}